WEBVTT

00:13:57.121 --> 00:14:00.496
and that energy, purpose and
commitment are renewed.

00:14:01.704 --> 00:14:05.662
This place, that many view is just wasted.
Time is actually precious.

00:14:07.954 --> 00:14:11.412
Bridges mostly applied his ideas
to companies getting taken over

00:14:11.412 --> 00:14:14.829
or reorganizing. Maybe your business
has used his framework

00:14:14.829 --> 00:14:16.412
for figuring out your transitions.

00:14:16.829 --> 00:14:20.329
I hadn't heard of him, but I've realized
that the research that I've done in

00:14:20.329 --> 00:14:23.454
the book I wrote about using boredom
as a productivity tool for

00:14:23.454 --> 00:14:27.121
the mind isn't actually all that different
. Anyway, I digress.

00:14:27.121 --> 00:14:32.204
The point is, first comes an ending,
then this neutral time,